### Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

### List Models
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/models
Accept: application/json

### List Personas (Guest)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/personas
X-Guest-ID: demo_guest_12345
Accept: application/json

### Create Conversation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Guest-ID: demo_guest_12345

{
  "title": "测试对话",
  "model": "deepseek",
  "persona_id": "deepseek"
}

### Stream Chat (SSE)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Guest-ID: demo_guest_12345

{
  "message": "你好，介绍一下你自己",
  "model": "deepseek",
  "persona_id": "deepseek",
  "web_search": "auto"
}
